# Metro's bundle-check output. `pnpm --filter @dthcms/mobile run bundle:check` compiles
# the Android bundle to prove every import resolves, and leaves 4.4MB of Hermes bytecode
# behind. The compile is the point; the output is disposable.
mobile/.expo-export/
.expo/

# Generated API documentation. Built from api/openapi.yaml by `pnpm run spec:docs` and by
# CI, which uploads it as an artifact. A 1.3MB self-contained page regenerated on every
# spec change does not belong in history; the contract it is built from does.
api/docs.html

# Tooling caches
.turbo/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
.gocache/

# Generated synthetic populations. Reproducible from a seed and a profile â€” `make synth`,
# `make synth-review` â€” so the recipe belongs in history and the output does not. A cohort
# file is also the one thing in this repository that would look like patient data to
# someone who found it out of context, which is a second reason not to commit one.
cohort*.ndjson
synthetic-review*.html

# session scratch - screenshots and the vendored-module tarball
Claude outputs/
gosync.tgz
